[{"title":"海上丹房联句","author":"虞堪","text":"秋高候海月，夜宿丹房清。\n紫气动琼户，白光摇素楹。\n霜凝万手杵，火伏三足铛。\n煌煌竖玉井，烂烂连赤城。\n变合铅永髓，交媾龙虎精。\n所以灵毓秘，服之身形轻。\n三花常结子，一胎忽腾婴。\n后天竟不死，终古真长生。\n孰云迈周?，政为凌商彭。\n乾坤大莫测，日月悭其行。\n大椿阅春秋，微虫啸昏明。\n造化几不息，循环互相成。\n天渊一飞跃，韝冶徒煎烹。\n道体讵割裂，名言孰纷争。\n超然万象表，蕞尔群目盲。\n扶摇鲲鹏化，?欿蝇蜹营。\n畴能较巨细，何用嗤辱荣。\n安期既遁世，鲁连亦逃名。\n飞度海水弱，鞭驱石梁平。\n完完白盘上，滟滟金波倾。\n犀光微照耀，怪状毕露呈。\n鳌戴涌兀突，鲸奔触喧轰。\n灵鼍杂鱼媵，舞若唯能狞。\n蜃吐起氛雾，豚喷飞沫霙。\n鲛呈绡错落，蚌献珠荧晶。\n一一苍螭立，双双赤鲩趟。\n何物比目鲽，况尔丫头?。\n鳖甲竟六缩，虾䖳难独撑。\n飘飖驻羽节，的皪蜚佩瑛。\n琴生跃鲤出，王子跨鹤迎。\n龙琯碎碣石，螺觥吸沧瀛。\n放此宽大量，解以无何酲。\n划然悟忘返，归欤咏遐征。\n既御鸿濛气，当作欸乃声。\n谪天本奇术，缩地若偶抨。\n局蹐顷步势，呼吸万里程。\n坐我已机席，笑子犹庭闳。\n葳蕤覆肺盖，踊跃鎗心兵。\n齿鼓击訇坎，音钟叩噌吰。\n婆娑?以发，傲兀瞪而瞠。\n微吟涩庄籁，独茧缫娲笙。\n鏦琤间金石，雰霏乱玑珵。\n䥫画逗溜壁，牙签响风棚。\n惊蛇逐毛颖，飞虹捲陶泓。\n万卷在手破，五车于腹盛。\n鬼谷应蓍策，罗浮證棋枰。\n果有弈局事，岂无高世情。\n室剑商镂绣，囊琴蜀锦赪。\n得趣始破绝，有神终合并。\n蒸炉萤焌焌，茗釜蛴嘤嘤。\n银丝过行脍，玛瑙重出?。\n神枣异桃核，仙芝类蓂茎。\n瓜开犀落瓠，榴破珠倾樱。\n红擘烂于火，青剖圜若缨。\n丹分盎大橘，殷对合抱柽。\n魁杓落睒睒，蒲牢发鈜鈜。\n齁鼾总辟易，猛省浑{耳堅}?。\n药兔罢秋捣，窗鸡候晨鸣。\n霜结鸳颈瓦，灯灺雁足檠。\n舞兴憵憵起，侠气冲冲横。\n客豪思横发，童倦嗔屡赓。\n冥搜入古差，狂歌错锵铿。\n啁啁泣魍魉，呱呱叫猱猩。\n真令东方白，尽使鬼神惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鼓枻","author":"虞堪","text":"兰枻鼓清流，独悲江上秋。\n屈生常悃款，渔父亦迟留。\n斑竹涵清泪，沧江没白鸥。\n钓竿斯可寓，随意泊吾舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与吕志学夜坐","author":"虞堪","text":"扰扰越城路，摇摇吴水春。\n自嗟沦落客，又送远游人。\n挟策长忧世，谋生独为亲。\n输君谈甓事，更向邺侯陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送冯令之官乌程","author":"虞堪","text":"好去乌程令，间关白发新。\n五弦应得趣，一剑只全贫。\n湖水家家绿，桃花树树春。\n几番兵燹地，天复惠凋民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵生航海之京","author":"虞堪","text":"之子天边去，远游沧海中。\n蓬莱十日到，云汉一槎通。\n夜静应瞻斗，秋高定转篷。\n慎闻尧治语，归慰钓渔翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李士贤检校使吴","author":"虞堪","text":"使者来吴日，多君属后车。\n全家当国难，孤直保民馀。\n秉节心仍壮，扬名信不虚。\n怀忠独怜孝，珍重史官书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送相德谦之越","author":"虞堪","text":"世路一何艰，风尘战血殷。\n送君阖庐浦，投客会稽山。\n恋阙头添白，寻亲泪复潸。\n台中论前绩，刀马岂容闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄魏秉中表兄","author":"虞堪","text":"海上魏公子，风流忆汉貂。\n别来良契阔，时节竟萧条。\n岁暮沧江远，天寒白鹤遥。\n艰难慎行处，吾欲老渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重寄","author":"虞堪","text":"客厌吴江冷，谁歌蜀道难。\n风尘应阻绝，归计且盘桓。\n腊雪明残夜，梅花耐薄寒。\n慇勤嘱毛颖，聊以报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄南浔潘隐君草堂","author":"虞堪","text":"湖头隐居好，竹树日萧森。\n对酒花当面，焚香鹤在阴。\n青山应似旧，岐路只如今。\n潘令思吾否，高情足谩吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬倪季敏南墅隐居","author":"虞堪","text":"季也端脩士，高閒独闭门。\n桑麻深雨露，鸡犬自朝暾。\n设以南州榻，陶然北海樽。\n何时觅渔者，相逐到桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邓高士","author":"虞堪","text":"海上玄真子，能诗似谪仙。\n从来披鹤?，长上钓渔船。\n袖有雌雄剑，囊无子母钱。\n一壶春自足，应不问先天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄徐生兼柬廉愚谷上人","author":"虞堪","text":"之子病来久，缘情多苦吟。\n经旬不会面，镇日废弹琴。\n雨过江澄练，梅酸树合阴。\n文殊应在座，摩诘好论心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠周可久","author":"虞堪","text":"漂泊风尘际，相逢湖水浔。\n繄君正哀愤，而我且狂吟。\n禾黍感行役，蓼莪思孝忱。\n忧来无复道，端处和鸣琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠净天镜讲师","author":"虞堪","text":"义天本无际，心镜夺方诸。\n白月离沧海，清风下太虚。\n扶宗谭般若，演教契真如。\n龙象朝朝集，松堂响粥鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次席帽山人王原吉韵赠石林上人","author":"虞堪","text":"石林峨海刹，杰出大方家。\n说偈瓶翻水，看经席散花。\n秋听潮信急，夜坐月痕斜。\n借问穷源客，曾乘几度槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用唐綦母著作留题龙兴寺诗韵赠长老閒公白云","author":"虞堪","text":"西蜀竟忘归，东林自掩扉。\n百年纯白发，独著旧缁衣。\n阅藏心源净，安禅鼻息微。\n天花如雨下，无个著空飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王使君季野飞云楼宴集","author":"虞堪","text":"翠黛生微晕，阑干下夕阳。\n乱蛙喧鼓吹，芳草满池塘。\n歌按黄金缕，诗传锦绣囊。\n焦桐谁自弄，还问蔡中郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵生席上","author":"虞堪","text":"清明才过日，踏雨到君家。\n列坐新行酒，比邻始种花。\n墙头红窈窕，杯面绿交加。\n归骑宁扶醉，还人插帽斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆与陆季宏对榻","author":"虞堪","text":"旅榻联宵话，心期一寸冰。\n春风欹玉树，夜雨落寒灯。\n世事嗟馀耳，人情见武陵。\n男儿四方志，摇落岂无凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读陈天倪处士传有怀其子惟寅惟允","author":"虞堪","text":"惜别经三月，相思寄五言。\n风尘淹逆旅，烟树锁离魂。\n行处松楸晚，吟时乌鸟昏。\n临文忆前行，重为洒啼痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋湖上看月","author":"虞堪","text":"楼台超有界，风月到无边。\n说幻难逃佛，凭虚已是仙。\n玄洲生碧草，净土出青莲。\n我爱杯中物，来随社里缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十日对菊","author":"虞堪","text":"撚花悲节过，无酒愀无欢。\n客里情怀恶，江头风雨寒。\n扬雄空识字，陶令苦辞官。\n荆璞应难抱，牙琴欲罢弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖村夜泊","author":"虞堪","text":"岁晚过湖边，缘村夜泊船。\n数家馀破屋，几度断吹烟。\n病犬惊篱罅，饥乌叫树颠。\n问津无处所，寒月照人眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔南书事","author":"虞堪","text":"偶即浔南地，川原路欲芜。\n老翁行乞食，稚子幼还扶。\n未放开河卒，犹差守戍夫。\n为农那可卜，愁我在江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澄江季丙卿留饮客邸","author":"虞堪","text":"一勺钱溪水，半年澄客心。\n风尘增感慨，山水倦登临。\n处处群游在，林林众木森。\n持杯骋怀思，还沛听佳音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩兴","author":"虞堪","text":"避地藏吾拙，衡门常自扃。\n豺狼时扰扰，风雨昼冥冥。\n海上琅玕折，山中芝草零。\n如何秉干羽，不见舞虞廷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村渔隐","author":"虞堪","text":"微茫烟水窟，窈窕野人家。\n屋里容书几，门前著钓槎。\n桃花春涨漫，桑树昼阴斜。\n欲问玄真子，栖迟几岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21217,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵沈仲说洞庭秋晚","author":"虞堪","text":"时花媚秋色，落日澹晴辉。\n橘亚丹枫树，江分白鸟矶。\n围棋应遁迹，把钓或忘归。\n谩道因诗瘦，高情深翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21218,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄朱叔重画山水卷","author":"虞堪","text":"娄东朱叔重，满卷画云烟。\n过越乘山轿，归吴放野船。\n危峰苍鹘上，远树白鸥前。\n每惬幽寻意，题诗为尔贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21219,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈松巢画","author":"虞堪","text":"秋山殊可爱，画此似匡庐。\n九叠青厓峻，万株红树疏。\n笋舆陶令入，莲社远公居。\n何日风尘静，松巢好读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21220,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登大觉寺琳公鉴湖楼","author":"虞堪","text":"谈笑宝楼开，湖光劈面来。\n浮云空翳槛，明镜若为台。\n野鸟衔花去，潭龙作雨回。\n坐参真法境，无意想蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21221,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文殊院壁","author":"虞堪","text":"文殊兰若旧，珠树网罗交。\n殿古馀狮座，林空见鸟巢。\n天花时作供，野菜日充庖。\n忽忆香山语，令人愿结茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21222,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭明寺暹上人房次韵题壁","author":"虞堪","text":"脱俗经云壑，寻僧到竹房。\n林飙发虚籁，潭影落天光。\n净观禅心寂，清斋道味长。\n南山寺相对，结屋好邻傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21223,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题暹上人可赋轩","author":"虞堪","text":"祗树给孤园，当阳辟小轩。\n天空澄际月，海净浴晨暾。\n雾隐南山豹，风传后夜猿。\n凭高殊可赋，观妙亦何言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21224,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游宋胡少师横山福寿兰若次韵书壁","author":"虞堪","text":"每到横山麓，都违濯世氛。\n僧留夜听雨，我自日看云。\n历历前朝寺，桓桓给事坟。\n凄凉莫嗟感，竹帛已传闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21225,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留题横塘般若寺","author":"虞堪","text":"西郭横塘寺，开门对越溪。\n潮生沧海近，云起碧山低。\n浮世惊前梦，回廊觅旧题。\n重怀先太史，曾共白云栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21226,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昔先太史与白云閒上人憩此今三十年矣而壁间遗墨尚新瞻仰徘徊不胜流涕因赋此以识岁月云","author":"虞堪","text":"华星不可摘，飞雨若为听。\n忽暝翻巴峡，兼秋响洞庭。\n甲兵连夜洗，丝竹暂时停。\n几度销银烛，沉思赋窅冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21227,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿坚公房咏高丽石琉璃","author":"虞堪","text":"石灯如仰月，云截水光寒。\n不为山灵秘，应从海若刓。\n中虚长寂照，表净即空观。\n绝胜青黎杖，寥寥伴夜阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21228,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪","author":"虞堪","text":"碧落瑶花满，分明属化工。\n江山如画里，天地只壶中。\n瑞应三番白，春无半点红。\n原头踏芳草，遮莫待东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云为闲上人赋用郑子封先生韵","author":"虞堪","text":"一片复一片，应无去住踪。\n悠扬轻似羽，变幻倏犹龙。\n宝月同瞻海，青莲别见峰。\n若招岩畔宿，飞散下堂钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居次韵六首用起句题 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"山居何所有，檐窦过晴云。\n灵物寻常见，尘嚣绝不闻。\n花关蜂作阵，松径鹿成群。\n莫怪寻幽约，长来避俗纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居次韵六首用起句题 其二","author":"虞堪","text":"龙山宛若龙，飞舞出群峰。\n霖雨终须作，闲云或可从。\n萧条何处寺，隐约数声钟。\n倏幻听经去，天花雨九重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居次韵六首用起句题 其三","author":"虞堪","text":"杂树带云栽，林间一径开。\n好莺鸣不绝，独鹤去还来。\n密荫生青霭，闲花落紫苔。\n为吟清昼寂，操几数徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居次韵六首用起句题 其四","author":"虞堪","text":"胜绝为人誇，山中宰相家。\n琅玕皆翡翠，金弹是枇杷。\n玄圃生奇玉，丹炉养嫩芽。\n熟知方外事，不比世间奢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居次韵六首用起句题 其五","author":"虞堪","text":"乳燕定新巢，翾翾过柳梢。\n自来帘幕下，不堕网罗交。\n细雨迷南陌，飞花接近郊。\n主家贫好在，破屋任人嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居次韵六首用起句题 其六","author":"虞堪","text":"好山看不尽，一望一番登。\n崖险森如戟，泉甘冷若冰。\n鸣钟传下界，著屐上高层。\n不是石桥客，何由识老僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周伯昂兵革后归义兴","author":"虞堪","text":"城郭已皆非，人烟触处稀。\n莫言前度事，但得一身归。\n妻子全当喜，乡邻在可依。\n孝侯还有庙，再拜勿歔欷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞云楼春夜会饮联句","author":"虞堪","text":"楼外雨萧骚，如何慰寂寥。\n画阑昏正倚，朱履夜从招。\n公子开东阁，先生莫后邀。\n熊徵恊吕望，凫舄伫王乔。\n自尚虞卿璧，谁吹伍子箫。\n玉壶承酒酌，银叶藉香烧。\n亹亹襟怀豁，飘飘气宇骄。\n过秦人罕论，识赵客难撩。\n文脉如泉涌，词源若海潮。\n每歌青玉案，长想赤阑桥。\n就醉翻金缕，相期折翠条。\n烟霞同啸傲，汗漫及渔樵。\n酒胜春衫薄，诗成蜡蠋销。\n悠扬通蹀梦，瘦损过蜂腰。\n最喜相邻近，惟怜失路遥。\n幸因投契谊，何以答琼瑶。\n瑟瑟低檐溜，冥冥动斗杓。\n结欢得知己，端不负春宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沧波","author":"虞堪","text":"沧波眇碧落，芦叶生秋风。\n一船不结缆，长啸月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旧筝","author":"虞堪","text":"雁逐暮云断，蝉惊秋梦寒。\n萧条关塞曲，不复和愁弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏异石","author":"虞堪","text":"观山有奇术，捾此天地根。\n白云飞不去，一片玉浑沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓目","author":"虞堪","text":"天远水复遥，白鸟独长往。\n当从息机人，发此天际想。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海岸图","author":"虞堪","text":"海岸水西流，看山正倚楼。\n迢迢烟九点，笑指是齐州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题醉李太白图","author":"虞堪","text":"汗漫鱼龙窟，消摇虎豹关。\n死生浑托醉，何独夜郎还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题列子乘风便面","author":"虞堪","text":"昔者列禦寇，泠然禦其风。\n方诸彻秋水，乃今见犹龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题青山白云 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"幽人卧春晓，四山云气迷。\n闭门□□□，叫杀护林鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21246,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题青山白云 其二","author":"虞堪","text":"人家青树合，僧寺白云封。\n谁共诗翁坐，夕阳听晚钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题青山白云 其四","author":"虞堪","text":"窅窅一带山，沈沈万林树。\n著我静者心，独得看云趣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柯参书竹 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"秋风来苍梧，白月下九疑。\n不见湘夫人，一枝空泪垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题倪元镇画竹树","author":"虞堪","text":"个个竹弄雨，丫丫树撑烟。\n还教来拜石，痴绝伴清妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题顾定之画出墙竹","author":"虞堪","text":"莫笑虎头痴，偏怜凤尾垂。\n粉墙遮不断，翠雨湿多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题朱叔仲所画青山白云横幅","author":"虞堪","text":"山青绿树深，白云更多少。\n忆尔越中行，扬帆看春晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陆季宏画碧桃花","author":"虞堪","text":"飞去三千里，开过几劫春。\n此言谁解得，还汝日东人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21253,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为立上人题云山欲雨卷","author":"虞堪","text":"白云不作雨，作雨但霏微。\n长罨青山路，唯教翠湿衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21254,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈慎独画","author":"虞堪","text":"菉竹在坡陁，兼葭隔洲渚。\n咫尺雨中秋，披图谩愁予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21255,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人扑蝶图","author":"虞堪","text":"双蝶忽飞来，扑之意偏好。\n绣扇著春堤，恐污宜男草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21256,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]